        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Drive Innovation and Acquisitions - By the end of fiscal 2030, we aim to have 25% of our total revenue derived from new products developed and launched within the prior five years.",
        "start_character": 4572,
        "end_character": 4752
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001036262-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001036262-26-000012-6129e5e415bab37e",
        "accession_number": "0001036262-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Electronic Test Products: In North America, we sell our InTest EMS products to semiconductor manufacturers through internal account representatives and independent, commissioned sales representatives.",
        "start_character": 41629,
        "end_character": 41829
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001036262-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001036262-26-000012-6129e5e415bab37e",
        "accession_number": "0001036262-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Environmental Technologies Products: We market our Temptronic®, Sigma, Thermonics®, and North Sciences brands under the umbrella name of InTest Thermal Solutions and sales to ATE manufacturers are handled directly by our own sales force and our network of independent representatives and distributors.",
        "start_character": 43902,
        "end_character": 44203
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001036262-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001036262-26-000012-6129e5e415bab37e",
        "accession_number": "0001036262-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "From time to time, we retain temporary workers or third-party contractors to assist us in manufacturing operations and engineering and product development projects.",
        "start_character": 58753,
        "end_character": 58917
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001036262-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001036262-26-000012-6129e5e415bab37e",
        "accession_number": "0001036262-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we provide a custom design service that will allow any of our customers to use virtually any tester, prober or handler combination with any type of device, such as analog, digital, mixed signal and radio frequency.",
        "start_character": 31649,
        "end_character": 31876
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001036262-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001036262-26-000012-6129e5e415bab37e",
        "accession_number": "0001036262-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we sell our products to a variety of different types of customers with varying levels of discounts and commission expense.",
        "start_character": 23375,
        "end_character": 23510
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001036262-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001036262-26-000012-6129e5e415bab37e",
        "accession_number": "0001036262-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, when the demands of engineering and product development projects exceed the capacity or knowledge of our in-house staff, we retain temporary third-party engineering and product development consultants to assist us.",
        "start_character": 51277,
        "end_character": 51504
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001036262-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001036262-26-000012-6129e5e415bab37e",
        "accession_number": "0001036262-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In order to remain competitive with these and other companies, we must continue to commit a significant portion of our personnel, financial resources, research and development and customer support to developing new products and maintaining customer relationships worldwide.",
        "start_character": 55058,
        "end_character": 55331
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001036262-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001036262-26-000012-6129e5e415bab37e",
        "accession_number": "0001036262-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the Life Sciences market, we provide image capture products, electronic test systems, and heating systems for medical device manufacturing, as well as equipment for critical applications within the medical cold chain for pharmaceuticals chillers used in chemical extraction and distillation processes.",
